ment, and the remaining shares vesting ratably on a monthly basis over the next three years. Vesting is conditioned on your continued employment with Yelp. The option will be a non-qualified stock option and will be subject to the terms of Yelp’s stock plan and a separate stock option agreement between you and Yelp.","context":"You will also be paid a one time signing bonus of $20,000 (less applicable taxes) within the first two weeks of your start date. This signing bonus will be earned evenly over your first year of employment with Yelp. In the event that your employment with Yelp terminates for any reason before the completion of twelve (12) full months with the Company, you will refund a pro-rata share of this signing bonus immediately.","section":"","block":9,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001345016-26-000066","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-07","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001345016","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1345016/000134501626000066/exhibit102alexlevyofferlet.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6f47dc312b630848af93a11955a6cc14860516840f801df3cf6f1a55bfceede3.bin","sha256":"6f47dc312b630848af93a11955a6cc14860516840f801df3cf6f1a55bfceede3"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"segmentIntelligence":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0}},"warnings":[]},{"version":1,"source":null,"layers":{"businessProfile":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"operatingKpis":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"managementExplanations":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"materialEvents":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"segmentIntelligence":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"om